# .agrules
# Project Rules and Context

## Tech Stack
- Language: Python (Backend/Pipelines), TypeScript/TSX (Frontend)
- Frameworks: React, Next.js (Web), potentially FastAPI or similar for API
- Tooling: Antigravity Customizations

## Project Goals
- Build and maintain the FaultTrace RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) system.
- Ensure high-quality data retrieval, indexing, and pipeline execution.

## Constraints
- Avoid breaking existing tests in `apps/api/tests/` and `patch_tests.py`.
- Maintain clean separation between packages (`core`, `data`, `pipelines`, `reporting`) and apps (`api`, `web`).
- Always use type hints in Python.
- Use functional components in React/TSX.
